"k": "7847",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "{AngryA}{body-pockets}But I saw somethin' worse, didn't I?"
},
{
"k": "7848",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "I'm sick and tired of the way you go around beatin' on people, and no one says shit about it!"
},
{
"k": "7849",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "You think you can just wipe it all away with a few nice words? I don't buy it, Bigby!"
