"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[yelling] Is that it?"
},
{
"k": "7852",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "Woodsman may be a drunk bastard, but you know he didn't have nothin' to do with this! You think he deserved that?"
},
{
"k": "7853",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "[helpful interjection]The East River."
},
{
"k": "7854",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_businessoffice_questiontj",
"en": "He wants to keep good people like you safe from the bad people."
},
